{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0bd7b29d-90cc-84f1-8f65-43d32e0906fb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T11:32:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, good morning. Well, it's just about noon, isn't it. Um, hold on a second, I can hear myself echoing. My headphones are paired to the wrong device, I think they're hooked to my tablet. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, a little bit of an echo but fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So I'm calling about a puddle. A big one. It's on Mill Street, right out front of 413, up the Hill, and it's across half the road. It does not go away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 413 Mill Street. Is this left over from rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing, no. It hasn't rained in, what, the better part of a month. Not a real rain. Everything else is dry as a bone and this one spot is just sitting there. Water the whole width of my side of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So it's standing water, dry weather. Is it clear water or does it look like something's running into it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Looks kind of gray, and it's got leaves and gunk floating on it. I think the drain is plugged. There's a grate right at the edge and I can see it's all packed with mud and leaves. The water just sits there and goes nowhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a clogged catch basin. Has it been like this a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weeks now. And it's been getting worse, honestly. Cars come by and splash right up on the sidewalk, and people have to walk out around it. In this cold it's starting to skin over with ice in the mornings, and that's all I need, somebody slipping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Have you reported it before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't called before, no, but I've been looking at it for weeks waiting for somebody to notice. You'd think somebody driving by would see it. Nobody has. So here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad you called. I'll put in a request for the drain to be checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like it cleaned out, is what I'm asking. Not just looked at. Cleaned. I took pictures too, a bunch of them, from the porch and from the curb. I can send them if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help, actually. Hang on, let me get this entered first. So, 413 Mill Street, Historic Hill, standing water that won't drain, dry weather, request to clean the catch basin. Is the grate on your side of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my side, right in front of the house, a little toward the corner. The puddle goes out about to the middle of the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is the water close to anyone's driveway or building, or is it just in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the road, thank goodness. It's not in anybody's cellar. It's just sitting there being a nuisance. A big, ugly, stinky nuisance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have a number in case someone needs to reach you about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-nine-one, great. For the photos, I'll give you an email address for the department. Do you have something to write with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm not good with the email on this phone, and the headphones are doing their thing. Can you just put in the notes that I have photos? If somebody calls me I'll figure out how to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that photos are available from you. That works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you know about when somebody might come? I mean, it's been a month already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say give it a week or so. The crews work through requests in order, and a plugged drain with ice forming will get bumped up a bit, so I'll flag that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd appreciate that. I'm just tired of looking at it, to be honest. All I want is somebody with a truck to come clean it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now. If it's still sitting there in a week, call back and we'll push it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will, believe me. Alright, thank you, Denise. Let me go fix these headphones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:32:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with those. Take care."
    }
  ],
